+In-flight Single Step coverage arms during an ordinary source block with three
+later motion blocks already queued and during an active G76 cut with later
+passes queued. It verifies that the active block or thread-plus-clearance unit
+finishes normally and motion remains at its boundary until Resume. While the
+step is armed and the active unit is still moving, both task and motion report
+unpaused; they change to paused only when motion reaches the latched boundary.
